li><li>{"3"}</li><li className={"max-sm:invisible"}>{"4"}</li><li>{"5"}</li><li className={"max-sm:invisible"}>{"6"}</li><li>{"7"}</li><li className={"max-sm:invisible"}>{"8"}</li><li>{"9"}</li><li className={"max-sm:invisible"}>{"10"}</li><li>{"11"}</li><li className={"max-sm:invisible"}>{"12"}</li><li>{"13"}</li></ol></div><div className={"custom-art-gantt-row"} style={{"--from": "1", "--to": "3"}} aria-hidden={"true"}><span className={"custom-art-gantt-label"}>{"Audit"}<small>{"Wk 1–2"}</small></span><span className={"custom-art-gantt-track"}><span className={"custom-art-gantt-bar custom-art-gantt-bar--ink"}><span className={"overflow-hidden max-sm:hidden"}>{"Read All"}</span></span></span></div><div className={"custom-art-gantt-row"} style={{"--from": "2", "--to": "5"}} aria-hidden={"true"}><span className={"custom-art-gantt-label"}>{"Roadmap"}<small>{"Wk 2–4"}</small></span><span className={"custom-art-gantt-track"}><span className={"custom-art-gantt-bar custom-art-gantt-bar--soft"}><span className={"overflow-hidden max-sm:hidden"}>{"Score & Cut"}</span></span></span></div><div className={"custom-art-gantt-row"} style={{"--from": "4", "--to": "9"}} aria-hidden={"true"}><span className={"custom-art-gantt-label"}>{"Launch"}<small>{"Wk 4–8"}</small></span><span className={"custom-art-gantt-track"}><span className={"custom-art-gantt-bar"}><span className={"overflow-hidden max-sm:hidden"}>{"Fixes, Then Weekly Tests"}</span></span></span></div><div className={"custom-art-gantt-row"} style={{"--from": "9", "--to": "14"}} aria-hidden={"true"}><span className={"custom-art-gantt-label"}>{"Scale"}<small>{"Wk 9–13"}</small></span><span className={"custom-art-gantt-track"}><span className={"custom-art-gantt-bar custom-art-gantt-bar--ink"}><span className={"overflow-hidden max-sm:hidden"}>{"Budget Follows Winners"}</span></span></span></div><div className={"custom-art-gantt-row"} style={{"--from": "11", "--to": "14"}} aria-hidden={"true"}><span className={"custom-art-gantt-label"}>{"Report"}<small>{"Day 90"}</small></span><span className={"custom-art-gantt-track"}><span className={"custom-art-gantt-day justify-self-end inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 h-9 ps-3 pe-3.5 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap bg-primary"}><i className={"ph-bold ph-flag-pennant"}></i>{"Day 90"}</span></span></div></div><figcaption>{"Thirteen weeks, four overlapping phases and one report. The overlaps are deliberate: the roadmap starts before the audit ends."}</figcaption></figure><h2 id={"ag2-art-audit"}>{"Weeks 1–2: The audit"}</h2><p>{"Nothing launches in the first fortnight. We read before we write: ad accounts, analytics, the CRM, search console and the last twelve months of email. Most of it is unglamorous work, and most of the money we later find comes from it."}</p><h3>{"What we look for first"}</h3><p>{"Tracking comes before everything else. In roughly half of the accounts we inherit, conversions are counted twice, missing a key event or credited to the wrong channel. Until that is fixed, every number in the audit is a guess, so the fix is usually the first thing we ship."}</p><ul><li>{"Spend going to campaigns with no measurable return."}</li><li>{"Landing pages that lose most visitors before the first scroll."}</li><li>{"What a customer is actually worth after twelve months, not after one order."}</li><li>{"Questions people search for that the site never answers."}</li></ul><p>{"The audit ends in a meeting, not a PDF. We walk through the findings with whoever signs the budget, and we agree on the "}<strong>{"three numbers we will be judged by."}</strong></p><h2 id={"ag2-art-roadmap"}>{"Weeks 2–4: The roadmap"}</h2><p>{"The roadmap starts before the audit is finished, because by the second week the shape of the problem is usually clear. We list every idea the team and the client can think of, then score each one on impact, confidence and effort. Most ideas do not survive the scoring, which is the point."}</p><figure><div className={"custom-art-kpi-row grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-4"} data-anim-stagger={"100"}><div className={"kpi-card kpi-card--flat"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><span className={"kpi-card-label"}>{"Ideas Scored"}</span><span className={"kpi-card-value"}>{"46"}</span><span className={"kpi-card-bars"} aria-hidden={"true"}><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><div className={"kpi-card kpi-card--flat"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><span className={"kpi-card-label"}>{"Make the Cut"}</span><span className={"kpi-card-value"}>{"12 "}<span className={"kpi-card-delta kpi-card-delta--up"}>{"26%"}</span></span><span className={"kpi-card-bars"} aria-hidden={"true"}><i style={{"--bar": "90%"}}></i><i style={{"--bar": "72%"}}></i><i style={{"--bar": "60%"}}></i><i style={{"--bar": "44%"}}></i><i style={{"--bar": "36%"}}></i><i style={{"--bar": "30%"}}></i><i style={{"--bar": "26%"}}></i></span></div><div className={"kpi-card kpi-card--flat"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><span className={"kpi-card-label"}>{"Live by Week 4"}</span><span className={"kpi-card-value"}>{"5 "}<span className={"kpi-card-delta"}><i className={"ph ph-lightning"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i>{"Quick Wins"}</span></span><svg className={"kpi-card-spark svg-draw"} data-anim={""} viewBox={"0 0 160 44"} preserveAspectRatio={"none"} aria-hidden={"true"}><path pathlength={"1"} d={"M2 40 L24 38 L46 39 L68 30 L90 26 L112 18 L134 12 L158 4"}></path></svg></div></div><figcaption>{"Median figures from our last twenty onboardings."}</figcaption></figure><p>{"What survives becomes a sequence, not a list. Each test has an owner, a start date and a single number that tells us whether it worked. Quick wins go first, not because they are big, but because they pay for the patience the larger bets need."}</p><figure className={"custom-art-quote overflow-clip pt-8 pb-7 px-6 rounded-2xl bg-(--custom-ink) sm:pt-11 sm:pb-10 sm:px-12 custom-ramp"}><span className={"custom-disc"} aria-hidden={"true"}><i className={"ph-fill ph-quotes"}></i></span><blockquote className={"mt-5"}><p className={"text-[clamp(1.5rem,1.2rem_+_1vw,2.125rem)] font-light leading-[1.22] tracking-[-0.03em] text-white text-balance"}>{"A roadmap that cannot say what you will stop doing is a wish list. "}<strong>{"Ours always starts with the cuts."}</strong></p></blockquote><figcaption className={"flex items-center gap-3"}><img className={"w-11 h-11 object-cover"} src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/240x240.svg"} alt={""} width={"240"} height={"240"} loading={"lazy"} /><span><strong className={"block text-[1rem]"}>{"Nora Whitfield"}</strong>{"Co-founder, Strategy"}</span></figcaption></figure><h2 id={"ag2-art-launch"}>{"Weeks 4–8: The launch"}</h2><p>{"By week four the first changes are live: the tracking fixes, budget moved away from the campaigns that were not earning it, and the landing page rewrite the audit flagged. Then the test calendar starts, at two or three experiments a week across channels."}</p><h3>{"One change at a time, per channel"}</h3><p>{"Tests run in parallel across channels, but never stacked on the same page or audience. When a landing page test and a new bidding strategy go live on the same day, nobody can say which one moved the number, and the result teaches you nothing."}</p><figure className={"custom-art-figure"}><div className={"mini-ui mini-ui-chart custom-art-chart"} data-anim={""} aria-hidden={"true"}><span className={"mini-ui-chart-legend"}><span><i></i>{"Revenue"}</span><span><i></i>{"Ad Spend"}</span></span><span className={"mini-ui-chart-plot"}><svg className={"mini-ui-chart-area"} viewBox={"0 0 300 120"} preserveAspectRatio={"none"}><path d={"M0 98C30 97 50 95 75 90S120 78 150 66S195 50 225 40S270 26 300 18V120H0Z"}></path></svg><svg className={"svg-draw"} viewBox={"0 0 300 120"} preserveAspectRatio={"none"} data-anim={""}><path pathlength={"0.5"} d={"M0 92C30 92 45 93 75 91S120 92 150 90S195 91 225 89S270 90 300 88"}></path><path pathlength={"0.5"} d={"M0 98C30 97 50 95 75 90S120 78 150 66S195 50 225 40S270 26 300 18"}></path></svg><span className={"mini-ui-chart-point"}></span><span className={"mini-ui-chart-tip mini-ui-surface"}><b>{"$184k"}</b>{"Week 8 · 4.1× Return"}</span></span><span className={"mini-ui-chart-axis"}><span>{"Wk 1"}</span><span>{"Wk 2"}</span><span>{"Wk 3"}</span><span>{"Wk 4"}</span><span>{"Wk 5"}</span><span>{"Wk 6"}</span><span>{"Wk 7"}</span><span>{"Wk 8"}</span></span></div><figcaption><strong>{"Ferncastle, weeks 1–8."}</strong>{" Spend held flat while revenue climbed after the week-four fixes."}</figcaption></figure><p>{"Expect the first fortnight of the launch to look noisy. Algorithms relearn, a few tests lose and the dashboard swings. We say this out loud at kickoff, so nobody panics in week five."}</p><h2 id={"ag2-art-scale"}>{"Weeks 9–13: Scale what worked"}</h2><p>{"The second half of the quarter is about concentration. Winning tests become the new baseline, the budget follows them, and the losers are written up and retired. This is also when the slower channels, search and lifecycle, show their first real numbers."}</p><div className={"custom-art-check grid gap-5 py-7 px-6 rounded-2xl sm:py-8 sm:px-9"}><p className={"custom-art-check-title flex items-center gap-3 text-[1.25rem] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-text"}><i className={"ph ph-scales grid place-items-center w-10 aspect-square text-[1.25rem]"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i>{"Before we raise a budget"}</p><ul className={"check-list"} role={"list"}><li><i className={"ph-bold ph-check"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i>{"The winning test has run for at least two full buying cycles."}</li><li><i className={"ph-bold ph-check"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i>{"The lift holds for new customers, not only returning ones."}</li><li><i className={"ph-bold ph-check"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i>{"Margin after ad cost stays above the floor we agreed in week two."}</li><li><i className={"ph-bold ph-check"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i>{"The landing page can carry twice the traffic without slowing down."}</li></ul></div><p>{"If any of those is a no, the budget waits. Scaling a result that is not real is the fastest way we know to lose a quarter of progress in a month."}</p><h3>{"Where the slow channels fit"}</h3><p>{"Search and lifecycle rarely win the first month. A rewritten category page needs weeks to be crawled, ranked and cited in AI answers, and a welcome flow needs a few hundred new subscribers before its numbers mean anything. We start both in week four, so they mature just as paid media reaches its ceiling. By week twelve they usually carry a third of the new revenue."}</p><h2 id={"ag2-art-report"}>{"Day 90: One report"}</h2><p>{"On day ninety we send one document, about six pages long. It answers four questions: what we changed, what it did to the three numbers we agreed in week two, what surprised us, and what we would do with the next ninety days."}</p><h3>{"The three numbers, before and after"}</h3><p>{"Every report opens with the same table: the three numbers we agreed in week two, where they stood on day one, where they stand now, and how sure we are that our work caused the change. When a number went the wrong way, it stays in the table with a sentence on why. Clients trust the green rows because the red ones are never hidden."}</p><p>{"There is no appendix of vanity charts. If a metric did not move the business, it does not make the report. Most clients forward it to their board unedited, which is the only review of our reporting we have ever needed."}</p><p>{"Then the next ninety days begin, and the plan gets shorter, because the audit is already done."}</p></article><div className={"custom-art-end flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 gap-x-5 mt-14 pt-8"}><span className={"custom-label"}>{"Filed Under"}</span><ul className={"custom-art-tags flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none"} role={"list"}><li><a href={"#page=demo-agency-2-insights"}>{"Strategy"}</a></li><li><a href={"#page=demo-agency-2-insights"}>{"Onboarding"}</a></li><li><a href={"#page=demo-agency-2-insights"}>{"Reporting"}</a></li></ul></div><aside className={"grid gap-6 mt-10 p-7 rounded-3xl sm:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8 sm:p-9 custom-paper"} aria-label={"About the author"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><span className={"custom-dots custom-dots--tr w-[60%] h-full"} aria-hidden={"true"}></span><img className={"custom-art-author-photo rounded-2xl object-cover"} src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/240x240.svg"} alt={"Portrait of Nora Whitfield"} width={"240"} height={"240"} loading={"lazy"} /><div className={"custom-art-author-body grid justify-items-start gap-1.5"}><p className={"custom-label"}>{"Written By"}</p><p className={"text-[clamp(1.5rem,1.3rem_+_0.6vw,1.875rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em] text-text"}>{"Nora Whitfield"}</p><p className={"text-[0.9375rem] text-soft"}>{"Co-founder, Strategy · Chicago"}</p><p className={"max-w-[34rem] mt-2.5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.6] text-soft"}>{"Ran growth at two venture-backed retailers before co-founding Framo. She still writes the first roadmap for every new client."}</p><div className={"flex items-center gap-5 mt-3"}><a href={"#page=demo-agency-2-team"} className={"btn btn-link btn-link-arrow px-0 font-semibold"}><span className={"link-arrow"} aria-hidden={"true"}></span>{"\n                                            Meet the Team\n                                        "}</a><a href={"#"} className={"social-link social-link--sm social-link--circle social-link--soft"} aria-label={"Nora Whitfield on LinkedIn"}><i className={"ph ph-linkedin-logo"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></div></div></aside></div></div></div></section><section id={"ag2-art-related"} className={"section custom-paper"} aria-labelledby={"ag2-art-related-title"}><span className={"custom-dots custom-dots--tr w-[min(40rem,60%)] h-[22rem]"} aria-hidden={"true"}></span><div className={"container"}><div className={"custom-head"}><h2 id={"ag2-art-related-title"} className={"custom-title"} da